                </owl:intersectionOf>
            </owl:Class>
        </rdfs:range>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Scope of the intervention: envelope, installation, automation, combined, according to the recommendation-type controlled vocabulary (Art. 8.2.f).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="es">Ámbito de la intervención: envelope, installation, automation, combined, según el vocabulario controlado de tipos de recomendación (Art. 8.2.f).</rdfs:comment>
